    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "##Exploration: Change Your Audience\r\n\r\nThis chatbot will take your writing and change it to appeal to a different audience.\r\n\r\n#### Task:\r\n\r\n* **Choose** one a purpose for using AI that you identified.\r\n* **Test** this AI chatbot to see how well it helps with your purpose.\r\n* **Judge** what AI did well and what it did not do well.\r\n\r\n_**Prompt example:**_\r\n\r\n_Change this sentence so that a 5 year old could understand: There are many phases of matter like solid, liquid, and gas._\r\n",
